Just you wait...

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:34.530
Are you serious?! This can't be happening!

00:21:37.230 --> 00:21:39.770
Oh, hell, here it comes...

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:25.880
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:26.900
This is Junko.

00:23:26.900 --> 00:23:30.330
There are still a lot of things 
to be anxious about, but I feel like

00:23:30.330 --> 00:23:33.040
it'd take something major 
to stop us from at least trying.

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:36.220
Next time on <i>Zombie Land 
Saga Revenge</i> Episode 11:

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:37.930
"All It Takes Is for You to Be There SAGA."

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:40.010
<b>All It Takes Is for You to Be There SAGA</b>

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:39.150
Please look forward to it.
